+ # Bear Share Sync
+ Automated pipeline: Bear #share → JSON Canvas → BlueBubbles preview → ClawHub publish.
+ - Bear app running with `grizzly` CLI installed and token configured
+ - `jq` available on PATH
+ - (Optional) BlueBubbles channel configured for preview delivery
+ - (Optional) `clawhub` CLI authenticated for publishing
+ ## Pipeline Steps
+ ### 1. Scan Bear for new #share notes
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ grizzly open-tag --name "share" --enable-callback --json --token-file ~/.config/grizzly/token
+ ```
+ ```
+ ```
+ ```
+ The script `scripts/sync_share_notes.sh` tracks seen note IDs in `~/.config/bear-share-sync/seen_ids.txt` to avoid reprocessing.
+ ### 2. Generate canvas node
+ Each new note becomes a JSON Canvas node:
+ - **ID**: `share_<sanitized_note_id>`
+ - **Type**: `text`
+ - **Color**: `"4"` (green)
+ - **Text**: `📌 <title>\n<summary>` (summary truncated to 300 chars)
+ - **Position**: auto-placed below lowest existing node
+ See [references/canvas_schema.md](references/canvas_schema.md) for full schema.
+ ### 3. Update agent_capabilities.canvas
+ CANVAS_FILE=./canvases/agent_capabilities.canvas scripts/sync_share_notes.sh
+ The script appends nodes to the existing canvas JSON. If the file doesn't exist, it creates one.
+ ### 4. Send preview via BlueBubbles
+ After the script runs, send the preview using the OpenClaw message tool:
+   "action": "send",
+   "channel": "bluebubbles",
+   "target": "<E.164 or chat_guid>",
+   "message": "<preview text>"
+ Set `BLUEBUBBLES_TARGET` env var to configure the default target group.
+ ### 5. Publish to ClawHub
+ clawhub publish ./bear-share-sync --slug bear-share-sync --name "Bear Share Sync" --version <semver> --changelog "<description>"
+ ## Environment Variables
+ | Variable | Default | Description |
+ |----------|---------|-------------|
+ | `CANVAS_FILE` | `agent_capabilities.canvas` | Path to the canvas JSON file |
+ | `BLUEBUBBLES_TARGET` | *(empty)* | E.164 number or chat_guid for preview |
+ | `BEAR_TOKEN_FILE` | `~/.config/grizzly/token` | Bear API token file |
+ | `STATE_FILE` | `~/.config/bear-share-sync/seen_ids.txt` | Processed note ID tracker |
+ | `DRY_RUN` | `false` | Skip BlueBubbles send if `"true"` |
+ ## Full Run
+ CANVAS_FILE=./canvases/agent_capabilities.canvas \
